    Notes:
    - Uid: 81191886
      Name: Summary
      Text: "This Frost DoT is a <color=#FFFF22>hard control</color> effect.\n\nThe
        victim\u2019s <color=#22FFFF>resistance</color> attribute has a chance to
        completely negate the effect, implemented using an <color=#22FF66>AttributeValue
        Condition</color> as the trigger.\n\nThe Frost DoT supports stacking.\nIts
        current stack count is automatically written into a Dynamic Variable: '<color=#FFFF22>Layer</color>'
        by the OverTimeEffect system.\n\n<color=#FFFF22>Layer</color> < 3: Each layer
        reduces movement speed by 25%\n\n<color=#FFFF22>Layer</color> \u2265 3: The
        target is Frozen for 3 seconds\n\nWhen Frozen is applied, the Frost DoT is
        removed, and the target\u2019s <color=#22FFFF>resistance</color> is temporarily
        set to 100 for 4 seconds, preventing repeated <color=#FFFF22>hard control</color>
        chains."
      Position: {x: 3.4285715, y: -967.4286}
      Size: {x: 877.1428, y: 577.1429}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 1
