        Notes:
        - Uid: 81191886
          Name: Summary
          Text: 'This is a frost DoT example.


            Because this is a hard
            control DoT, the resistance attribute of the victim can help immune to
            this effect randomly. We used a AttributeValue condition as trigger to
            achieve this.


            The forst DoT can be layered, the layer count
            will be auto wrote into a Dynamic Variable called ''Layer'' by the OverTimeEffect
            system,  So we read this layer count in this graph, when it is less than
            3, we reduce the moving speed of the victim by 25% each layer. When it
            is greater or equal than 3, we put the victim in forzen state for 3 seconds
            and remove this DoT from the victim.'
          Position: {x: 142.28572, y: -845.7143}
          Size: {x: 853.1429, y: 452.00003}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 1
